WEBVTT

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:50.387
| say, Anton.

00:01:50.411 --> 00:01:54.624
Interesting fighters have all but disappeared...

00:01:54.648 --> 00:01:54.858
"Tokugawa"

00:01:54.882 --> 00:01:56.782
"Tokugawa"
Have they, sir?

00:02:03.524 --> 00:02:08.538
Ones like you and Orochi Doppo,
back in the day...

00:02:08.562 --> 00:02:13.343
These chaps now, they don't
get my blood stirring anymore.

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:16.012
Mayhaps it's my age?

00:02:16.036 --> 00:02:20.701
Sir. Shall I get your
blood stirring once more?

00:02:21.509 --> 00:02:25.889
-I have interesting news...
--How interesting?

00:02:25.913 --> 00:02:29.125
--Exceptionally.
--Say it.

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:34.698
A man showed up in Rio de Janeiro
several months ago.

00:02:34.722 --> 00:02:37.000
A Japanese.

00:02:37.024 --> 00:02:42.038
That man- no, technically,
he's still a boy-

00:02:42.062 --> 00:02:46.376
is Hanma Yujiro's son!

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:47.377
What?!

00:02:47.401 --> 00:02:52.498
The Ogre had a son.
What do you think, sir?

00:03:03.851 --> 00:03:09.756
"Path to the Holy Land”

00:03:10.524 --> 00:03:13.803
| had no idea the Ogre had a child...

00:03:13.827 --> 00:03:15.572
How careless of me...

00:03:15.596 --> 00:03:20.243
Incredible, sir. I didn't
know you knew him...

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:21.211
Inari!

00:03:21.235 --> 00:03:25.749
1 AM the promoter of
the underground arena.

00:03:25.773 --> 00:03:30.520
In here I've data of the
world's strongest men: height, weight,

00:03:30.544 --> 00:03:33.023
chest size, reach, foot
strength, and back strength,

00:03:33.047 --> 00:03:36.026
not to mention birthdates to
blood types, astrological signs,

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:39.129
families, women, and everything else!

00:03:39.153 --> 00:03:40.830
Forgive my ignorance.

00:03:40.854 --> 00:03:43.033
So, is he any good?

00:03:43.057 --> 00:03:47.504
His name is Hanma Baki,
written as "sword fang"...

00:03:47.528 --> 00:03:51.241
His name matters not!
| asked if he's any good!

00:03:51.265 --> 00:03:58.848
Two years ago, at the mere age of 13,
he made sport of Yuri Chakovsky.

00:03:58.872 --> 00:04:01.785
However, that was just a prelude.

00:04:01.809 --> 00:04:06.389
He apparently trounced Hanayama Kaoru
immediately afterward.

00:04:06.413 --> 00:04:08.925
My word! That brawling master?!

00:04:08.949 --> 00:04:15.932
Can you believe it? A 13-year old runt
withstood his grip attacks!

00:04:15.956 --> 00:04:18.368
Remarkable...!

00:04:18.392 --> 00:04:23.173
This is more of a suspicious rumor
than actual information,

00:04:23.197 --> 00:04:28.812
but a while after fighting Hanayama,
Baki faced off with the Ogre...

00:04:28.836 --> 00:04:30.213
Come again?!

00:04:30.237 --> 00:04:34.417
Supposedly a number of men
associated with Baki witnessed it,

00:04:34.441 --> 00:04:38.622
but not a single one
wants to talk about it.

00:04:38.646 --> 00:04:41.224
What on earth happened?

00:04:41.248 --> 00:04:43.026
Good guestion.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:48.031
At any rate, rumors about Hanma Baki
disappeared entirely after that...

00:04:48.055 --> 00:04:50.233
Perhaps he lost to the Ogre...?

00:04:50.257 --> 00:04:56.806
This is only my educated guess
on what the wounded kid did

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.993
until he showed up in Rio
several months ago, but...

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:38.464
You wanna get better at fighting?

00:05:41.775 --> 00:05:44.437
You wanna have a real fight?

00:05:54.121 --> 00:05:56.866
You want to free-fight?

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:00.070
Then Brazil's the place for you.

00:06:00.094 --> 00:06:04.774
You're just wastin' your time
wandering around America.

00:06:04.798 --> 00:06:09.167
Ain't been any exciting
fighters lately...

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.646
You wanna fight no-rules?

00:06:34.294 --> 00:06:37.320
Then make for Brazil.

00:06:38.065 --> 00:06:40.056
Brazil.

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:54.157
And then several months ago,
Baki appeared in Rio.

00:06:54.181 --> 00:06:56.493
To see Dixon...

00:06:56.517 --> 00:07:00.897
=Truly?
--A friend there has confirmed it.

00:07:00.921 --> 00:07:02.320
And then?

00:07:08.629 --> 00:07:10.573
He's loaded...

00:07:10.597 --> 00:07:13.009
Hanma Baki-san, yes?

00:07:13.033 --> 00:07:14.844
I've been expecting you.

00:07:14.868 --> 00:07:15.812
Um...

00:07:15.836 --> 00:07:20.817
Dixon has been eagerly awaiting you
since your call this morning.

00:07:20.841 --> 00:07:23.503
Thanks...

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:35.165
In here is the glory of
Dixon's official 700-0 record.

00:07:35.189 --> 00:07:38.802
700...2!

00:07:38.826 --> 00:07:41.261
Dixon waits.

00:07:44.965 --> 00:07:47.477
Pardon my entrance.

00:07:47.501 --> 00:07:49.196
Thanks for coming.

00:07:50.037 --> 00:07:53.098
| hear you wanna get strong, amigo?

00:07:57.945 --> 00:08:00.690
How did you get those injuries?

00:08:00.714 --> 00:08:04.027
Getting strong is a good thing, amigo.

00:08:04.051 --> 00:08:08.511
I do practice to get strong.
Day after day...

00:08:12.226 --> 00:08:15.672
Even the day I meet friends
or break up with my woman.

00:08:15.696 --> 00:08:17.574
Everyday...

00:08:17.598 --> 00:08:21.377
Then, one day, I realize I was strong.

00:08:21.401 --> 00:08:24.814
Then what do you think happened, amigo?

00:08:24.838 --> 00:08:31.387
My opponents look like bonitas--
yes, like very nice women.

00:08:31.411 --> 00:08:36.125
The bonitas, they give me
an impatient look that says,

00:08:36.149 --> 00:08:38.413
"Come on! Come on!"

00:08:44.258 --> 00:08:48.538
| bite my opponents like
that and keep winning.

00:08:48.562 --> 00:08:52.795
Out of 700 fights,
I lose not even once!

00:09:01.775 --> 00:09:04.608
Until recently, anyways...

00:09:05.712 --> 00:09:09.225
If it's tough guys you want,
go back to Tokyo.

00:09:09.249 --> 00:09:14.085
The unbelievable fighting arena
I lost at is there.

00:09:15.188 --> 00:09:16.332
Arena...?

00:09:16.356 --> 00:09:21.905
An underground arena where
the world's strongest men gather...

00:09:21.929 --> 00:09:25.475
The so-called
"Holy Land of Fighting".

00:09:25.499 --> 00:09:30.980
It was there I was
toyed with like a kid!

00:09:31.004 --> 00:09:33.063
Tokyo...?

00:09:35.475 --> 00:09:39.155
You'll lose everything, amigo!
The constant days of training!

00:09:39.179 --> 00:09:43.626
Everything you sacrificed to
get stronger! The family you made!

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:46.195
Your wealth! Your women!

00:09:46.219 --> 00:09:48.932
Losing takes everything away!

00:09:48.956 --> 00:09:53.120
Do you understand what it
means to get strong, kid?!

00:10:01.101 --> 00:10:05.515
All the strongest men gather there?

00:10:05.539 --> 00:10:10.753
If so, then he- Hanma Yujiro-
will eventually show up, too!

00:10:10.777 --> 00:10:14.907
Who should I see to enter, Mister?

00:10:16.683 --> 00:10:20.029
In the 30 years I've tried
my hand at fighting...

00:10:20.053 --> 00:10:23.566
Please...! Tell me!

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:28.084
...this is the youngest samurai
I've ever seen!

00:10:29.129 --> 00:10:33.498
Baki has likely returned to Japan.

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:40.407
And he will come to you, sir.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:45.621
Interesting news, indeed!

00:10:45.645 --> 00:10:49.859
In fact, he may already be here.

00:10:49.883 --> 00:10:51.647
Stop right there!

00:10:54.221 --> 00:10:57.213
An impressive fighting spirit!

00:10:58.792 --> 00:11:03.539
This is Kano Shumei,
head of my bodyguards.

00:11:03.563 --> 00:11:07.343
It's a shame that your surprise
attack ended in failure.

00:11:07.367 --> 00:11:11.748
| merely gave some
old bones a wakeup call.

00:11:11.772 --> 00:11:16.352
Seeing as I didn't sense any skill,
| can only guess you've gone senile.

00:11:16.376 --> 00:11:19.922
| wouldn't be talkin' all stuck-up, kid!

00:11:19.946 --> 00:11:23.493
Want me to scrap with you right here?!

00:11:23.517 --> 00:11:26.817
Can't either of you take a joke?!

00:11:30.724 --> 00:11:35.204
I like your style.
Now I can rest easy tonight.

00:11:35.228 --> 00:11:37.287
Goodnight, sir.

00:11:38.198 --> 00:11:40.276
He's definitely top-class...

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:45.431
He already sensed the ominous
energy hanging over the compound...

00:12:32.686 --> 00:12:35.765
Thought so. The son of Hanma...

00:12:35.789 --> 00:12:37.733
Do you know who I am?

00:12:37.757 --> 00:12:41.921
Doesn't matter. You're an enemy
if you get in my way!

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:51.013
There goes my sense of relief...

00:12:51.037 --> 00:12:54.234
The Ogre raised one hell of a boy...

00:12:58.612 --> 00:13:02.158
Alright, Musashi.
Be a good boy and stay here.

00:13:02.182 --> 00:13:06.415
Wait, you've always been a good boy.

00:13:59.506 --> 00:14:05.087
To think all that energy was
coming from a boy like you...

00:14:05.111 --> 00:14:07.590
Talk about intense spirit...!

00:14:07.614 --> 00:14:11.676
--Why are you here?
--Let me see Tokugawa-san!

00:14:12.886 --> 00:14:15.753
If you wish to meet with the boss...

00:14:18.825 --> 00:14:21.871
---save it for AFTER
you've dodged my shodan!

00:14:21.895 --> 00:14:25.641
That's the same stance as mine...!

00:14:25.665 --> 00:14:31.948
| take it you heard about the
underground arena, grew interested,

00:14:31.972 --> 00:14:36.285
and came to personally
speak with the boss.

00:14:36.309 --> 00:14:37.486
Am I right?!

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.222
Yup!

00:14:39.246 --> 00:14:41.123
This guy's strong!

00:14:41.147 --> 00:14:46.262
Then let me tell you something
interesting, my honest friend.

00:14:46.286 --> 00:14:49.899
If by remote chance
you ARE able to defeat me,

00:14:49.923 --> 00:14:53.450
you could enter the arena
starting as early as tomorrow.

00:14:54.794 --> 00:15:01.043
After all, I am one of the less
than 50 from around the world

00:15:01.067 --> 00:15:04.298
who is an official fighter of
the "Holy Land of Fighting".

00:15:24.758 --> 00:15:26.936
He blocked it!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:32.490
Oh? You act as if you can't
believe you were defended against.

00:15:41.608 --> 00:15:45.488
Who is this guy?!
He's not countering at all...!

00:15:45.512 --> 00:15:47.810
I've never seen this before!

00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:50.926
Huh?

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:54.563
He's ripping off my stance again...!

00:15:54.587 --> 00:15:57.900
See, whenever you imitate
an opponent's stance like this,

00:15:57.924 --> 00:16:02.938
you get a good idea of what
attacks to expect and not expect.

00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:05.908
Protection is the very
essence of self-defense.

00:16:05.932 --> 00:16:08.511
Basic single attacks
are all you really need

00:16:08.535 --> 00:16:12.181
if you possess a perfect defense.

00:16:12.205 --> 00:16:17.953
Even a woman's slap is quite effectual,
for example.

00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:22.992
Especially with guys who've lost
confidence in their own offense,

00:16:23.016 --> 00:16:25.713
much as you did just now!

00:16:27.187 --> 00:16:29.398
Cut the--

00:16:29.422 --> 00:16:31.356
--Crap!

00:16:35.095 --> 00:16:36.722
Shodan! (First Strike}

00:16:52.212 --> 00:16:57.173
Why didn't you follow that up?
It was the perfect chance, too...

00:16:58.918 --> 00:17:04.567
You can still talk?
After taking that blow head-on...?

00:17:04.591 --> 00:17:09.572
What're you talkin' about?
| only got hit once.

00:17:09.596 --> 00:17:12.361
I'm just getting started!

00:17:17.036 --> 00:17:18.714
That's more like it...!

00:17:18.738 --> 00:17:22.718
What would someone like you know
about the underground arena?!

00:17:22.742 --> 00:17:24.267
Nothing!

00:17:32.218 --> 00:17:34.846
In that case, allow me to tell you!

00:17:37.724 --> 00:17:42.371
The underground arena, also known
as the "Holy Land of Fighting",

00:17:42.395 --> 00:17:46.509
was started 11 generations before
the current Tokugawa Mitsunari

00:17:46.533 --> 00:17:50.629
by Tokugawa Mitsukuni
during the Edo Period.

00:17:51.471 --> 00:17:53.549
Mito-no-Komon-sama, huh?!

00:17:53.573 --> 00:17:57.553
Starting with Mitsukuni,
the spirit of love for fighting

00:17:57.577 --> 00:18:01.241
has been passed down unbroken
to the current Mitsunari!

00:18:02.248 --> 00:18:03.875
So what?!

00:18:10.557 --> 00:18:13.068
The issue here is one of status!

00:18:13.092 --> 00:18:17.072
| don't know your situation, but a
punk who suddenly attacks at night

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:23.112
and slaughters residents must not
be allowed into the sacred arena!

00:18:23.136 --> 00:18:25.281
Screw that!

00:18:25.305 --> 00:18:27.116
What...?!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:30.586
The strongest men gather here, right?

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:34.757
In which case,
| absolutely MUST get there!

00:18:34.781 --> 00:18:36.492
What for?

00:18:36.516 --> 00:18:39.829
| heard from a guy who entered once.

00:18:39.853 --> 00:18:45.534
Said I'd lose everything if I go there.
But I don't care about that.

00:18:45.558 --> 00:18:49.405
| just wanna win. There's no doubt
he'll show up there eventually.

00:18:49.429 --> 00:18:52.508
| want to beat the
world's strongest man!

00:18:52.532 --> 00:18:55.010
No matter what happens,
I will beat him!

00:18:55.034 --> 00:18:57.413
- "Him?"
--Yeah!

00:18:57.437 --> 00:19:01.601
That's why I want to
enter the arena! No matter what!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.688
What's so funny?!

00:19:05.712 --> 00:19:07.223
You're really something.

00:19:07.247 --> 00:19:11.343
Your overflowing battle spirit
and tenacity deserve admiration.

00:19:12.185 --> 00:19:16.765
However, you cannot be allowed
to enter without defeating me.

00:19:16.789 --> 00:19:21.504
My pleasure! I can't afford
to get tripped up here!

00:19:21.528 --> 00:19:23.257
The same thing again!

00:19:25.298 --> 00:19:26.709
I knew it!

00:19:26.733 --> 00:19:28.132
What?!

00:19:34.207 --> 00:19:37.720
The son of Hanma.
Do you know who I am?

00:19:37.744 --> 00:19:42.224
Doesn't matter. You're an
enemy if you get in my way!

00:19:42.248 --> 00:19:47.948
The Ogre's son... Baki,
written as "sword fang"...

00:19:55.261 --> 00:19:58.874
You're seriously a fighter
in the underground arena?

00:19:58.898 --> 00:20:00.409
What did you say?!

00:20:00.433 --> 00:20:02.411
I've been thinking.

00:20:02.435 --> 00:20:06.429
Your defense is definitely good,
but your attacks--

00:20:07.307 --> 00:20:09.105
--Are too straight!

00:20:42.308 --> 00:20:43.819
He's right.

00:20:43.843 --> 00:20:51.226
Sneaking in at night and injuring guards
to satisfy my desires...

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:53.195
It's a horrible way to act.

00:20:53.219 --> 00:20:57.952
But I chose the hardest and
most straightforward method!

00:21:00.026 --> 00:21:02.358
Where is everyone?

00:21:09.769 --> 00:21:13.215
What on earth?! Who are you?!

00:21:13.239 --> 00:21:14.883
Hanma Baki!

00:21:14.907 --> 00:21:18.887
Please let me enter the arena!
I'll get even stronger!

00:21:18.911 --> 00:21:22.905
Two or three times more!
To defeat Hanma Yujiro!

00:21:25.184 --> 00:21:28.864
He is no ordinary man, you know.

00:21:28.888 --> 00:21:33.702
So you have the skill to crush Kano,
bottom of the C-League...

00:21:33.726 --> 00:21:35.237
C-League?

00:21:35.261 --> 00:21:38.774
Would you like to switch with him
and start from the bottom?

00:21:38.798 --> 00:21:40.232
So you'll--

00:21:41.834 --> 00:21:47.716
| warmly welcome you to the "Holy Land
of Fighting" underground arena!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:53.255
Thank you! Where is the arena, anyway?

00:21:53.279 --> 00:21:58.046
A place that will much surprise you...

00:22:44.864 --> 00:22:50.412
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.436 --> 00:22:56.018
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.042 --> 00:23:01.690
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.714 --> 00:23:06.695
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.719 --> 00:23:12.234
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.258 --> 00:23:17.773
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.797 --> 00:23:23.445
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.469 --> 00:23:28.984
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.008 --> 00:23:34.656
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:40.141
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.163 --> 00:23:51.995
"Next Episode”

00:23:54.400 --> 00:23:57.813
Time passes, and the boy returns.

00:23:57.837 --> 00:24:02.751
The curtain rises on a new era that
revolves around a "fighting holy land."”

00:24:02.775 --> 00:24:07.122
The boy goes to the grand
battlefield of amusement,

00:24:07.146 --> 00:24:10.659
for the man will come to a
place filled with strength.

00:24:10.683 --> 00:24:15.030
The boy continues to
fight for a new dream.

00:24:15.054 --> 00:24:19.992
"Next Episode: Gathering”
